{% comment %}
  The "our graduates train at" logo row.

  Shared by the homepage proof band and the About page's credibility section.
  Extracted rather than copied: the logo list is a case statement mapping a
  merchant's choice to an asset AND its intrinsic size, and a second copy would
  drift the moment a logo was added to one and not the other.

  THE LOGOS ARE MASKED, not <img>. Each is a theme asset used as a CSS mask so
  it takes the row's colour, which is what lets one SVG sit on navy here and on
  white on About. suf.css is compiled and cannot call asset_url, so the mask URL
  and the intrinsic size arrive as inline custom properties.

  ADDING A LOGO means adding an asset AND a case below. Deliberate: a logo is a
  claim about a real company, so it should not be possible to add one by typing
  a filename into the theme editor.

  Usage:
    {% render 'suf-gymline', blocks: section.blocks, label: section.settings.x %}

    blocks   the section's blocks. Only `logo` and `badge` types are read.
    label    the small caps lead-in. Optional.
{% endcomment %}

{%- assign logo_blocks = blocks | where: 'type', 'logo' -%}
{%- assign badge_blocks = blocks | where: 'type', 'badge' -%}

{%- if logo_blocks.size > 0 or badge_blocks.size > 0 -%}
  <div class="suf-gymline">
    {%- if label != blank -%}
      <span class="suf-gymline__cap">{{ label | escape }}</span>
    {%- endif -%}

    {%- for block in blocks -%}
      {%- if block.type == 'logo' -%}
        {%- liquid
          case block.settings.logo
            when 'lifetime'
              assign file = 'suf-logo-lifetime.svg'
              assign w = '141px'
              assign h = '30px'
            when 'equinox'
              assign file = 'suf-logo-equinox.svg'
              assign w = '172px'
              assign h = '26px'
            when 'genesis'
              assign file = 'suf-logo-genesis.svg'
              assign w = '92px'
              assign h = '80px'
            else
              assign file = blank
          endcase
        -%}
        {%- if file != blank -%}
          <span
            class="suf-gymline__logo"
            role="img"
            aria-label="{{ block.settings.label | escape }}"
            style="--suf-logo-mask: url({{ file | asset_url }}); --suf-logo-w: {{ w }}; --suf-logo-h: {{ h }}"
            {{ block.shopify_attributes }}
          ></span>
        {%- endif -%}
      {%- elsif block.type == 'badge' -%}
        <span class="suf-gymline__text" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
          {{- block.settings.text | escape | newline_to_br -}}
        </span>
      {%- endif -%}
    {%- endfor -%}
  </div>
{%- endif -%}
